<!DOCTYPE html><!--VSKYtO30QEBfiRuTrlJPA--><html lang="en" class="ibm_plex_sans_63fd0d02-module__ixtqia__variable jetbrains_mono_9c633e15-module__v6TfTG__variable"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/03fc1b4a8d284b5e-s.p.af4fcd24.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/051742360c26797e-s.p.102b7f24.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" as="image" imageSrcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Fgithub-copilot-free-tier-review.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Fgithub-copilot-free-tier-review.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Fgithub-copilot-free-tier-review.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Fgithub-copilot-free-tier-review.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Fgithub-copilot-free-tier-review.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Fgithub-copilot-free-tier-review.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Fgithub-copilot-free-tier-review.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Fgithub-copilot-free-tier-review.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" imageSizes="100vw"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/chunks/b4d71cd14c52d111.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/chunks/48115f94f1a8a325.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/ef594b86957a718b.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/82abf2d65f5428ae.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/aee6c7720838f8a2.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0e9f8bc36c80a37f.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-e5b80e943977c4b8.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/92222cc0e6949ba9.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/d7561a899452c674.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js" async=""></script><meta name="next-size-adjust" content=""/><title>GitHub Copilot Free Tier: Is It Worth It for Beginners?</title><meta name="description" content="GitHub Copilot&#x27;s free plan gives you 2,000 completions and 50 chat requests a month. Here&#x27;s what beginners actually get — and when to upgrade or switch."/><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://stackbrief.dev/article/github-copilot-free-tier-review"/><meta name="google-site-verification" content="wRhgmu7ko6XNIyuOTJoBQ51pH-yM4LP-6jJ2IrgPwrY"/><meta property="og:title" content="GitHub Copilot Free Tier: Is It Worth It for Beginners?"/><meta property="og:description" content="GitHub Copilot&#x27;s free plan gives you 2,000 completions and 50 chat requests a month. Here&#x27;s what beginners actually get — and when to upgrade or switch."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://stackbrief.dev/article/github-copilot-free-tier-review"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://stackbrief.dev/api/og?title=GitHub%20Copilot%20Free%20Tier%3A%20Is%20It%20Worth%20It%20for%20Beginners%3F&amp;category=review&amp;description=GitHub%20Copilot%27s%20free%20plan%20gives%20you%202%2C000%20completions%20and%2050%20chat%20requests%20a%20month.%20Here%27s%20what%20beginners%20actually%20get%20%E2%80%94%20and%20when%20to%20upgrade%20or%20switch."/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="GitHub Copilot Free Tier: Is It Worth It for Beginners?"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="GitHub Copilot Free Tier: Is It Worth It for Beginners?"/><meta name="twitter:de