 Autocomplete in 2026?</h2><p class="ArticleCard-module__dO8f5a__description">Codeium review for beginners — unlimited free AI autocomplete across 70+ languages in VS Code, JetBrains, and Neovim. How does it stack up against Copilot?</p><span class="ArticleCard-module__dO8f5a__date">May 10, 2026</span></div></a><a class="ArticleCard-module__dO8f5a__card" href="/article/run-openclaw-free-gemini-api"><div class="ArticleCard-module__dO8f5a__imageWrapper"><img alt="How to Run OpenClaw for Free with Gemini&#x27;s Free API" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="ArticleCard-module__dO8f5a__image" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 400px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Frun-openclaw-free-gemini-api.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Frun-openclaw-free-gemini-api.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Frun-openclaw-free-gemini-api.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Frun-openclaw-free-gemini-api.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Frun-openclaw-free-gemini-api.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Frun-openclaw-free-gemini-api.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Frun-openclaw-free-gemini-api.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Frun-openclaw-free-gemini-api.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farticles%2Frun-openclaw-free-gemini-api.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="ArticleCard-module__dO8f5a__body"><span class="ArticleCard-module__dO8f5a__category">guide</span><h2 class="ArticleCard-module__dO8f5a__title">How to Run OpenClaw for Free with Gemini&#x27;s Free API</h2><p class="ArticleCard-module__dO8f5a__description">Run OpenClaw for free by routing it through Google&#x27;s free Gemini API